      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Mientras recorría la isla, la gente acudía a él en busca de ayuda y de enseñanza.",
          "en": "As he traveled across the island, people came to him for help and for teaching."
        },
        {
          "es": "En una aldea le pidieron una bendición que pudieran guardar para siempre.",
          "en": "In one village, they asked him for a blessing they could keep forever."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces se cortó un mechón de pelo y se lo dio, para que lo guardaran en su templo.",
          "en": "So he cut a lock of his own hair and gave it to them, to keep in their temple."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ese templo todavía se llama Rambut Siwi: el cabello venerado.",
          "en": "That temple is still called Rambut Siwi: the worshipped hair."
        }
      ],
