      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Nirartha no peleó. En cambio, usó su poder para mover la roca mar adentro.",
          "en": "Nirartha did not fight. Instead, he used his power to move the rock out into the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después se quitó la faja, la tela larga que llevaba atada a la cintura, y la tiró al agua.",
          "en": "Then he took off his sash, the long cloth tied around his waist, and threw it into the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "La faja se convirtió en serpientes de mar, con franjas blancas y negras, para cuidar la roca para siempre.",
          "en": "The sash turned into sea snakes, banded black and white, to guard the rock forever."
        },
        {
          "es": "Si fueras el jefe, ¿igual habrías intentado echarlo? Cuéntanos en los comentarios.",
          "en": "If you were the chief, would you still have tried to chase him away? Tell us in the comments."
        }
